    "text": "audilous.com\nwebsite\nLas Vegas\nLas Vegas Motor Speedway to Host Key NASCAR Cup Series Races in 2026 But Not Truck Series\nBy Nick Bonsanto,\n8 hours agoLas Vegas Motor Speedway will continue to be a significant venue for NASCAR events in 2026, hosting two NASCAR Cup Series races scheduled for March 15 and October 4. The October race is particularly noteworthy as it will be part of the Round of 12 in the NASCAR playoffs. Additionally, the track will host two NASCAR O’Reilly Auto Parts Series races on March 14 and October 3.\n1",
